<title>HONG KONG: Min Xin invests in China toll roads.</title>
<headline>Min Xin invests in China toll roads.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Min Xin Holdings Ltd said on Monday it would pay US$18 million for interests in two toll roads in China's Fujian province.</p>
<p>It would form a venture company with Zhangzhou Highway Traffic Industrial Corp to manage and operate the existing Zhangzhou section of national highway 319.</p>
<p>Min Xin said it had also agreed to pay US$6.0 million to set up a joint venture with Fujian Ningde Transport Development Co to manage and operate the 82 km Fuan-Zherong section of national highway 104.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6369</p>
</text>
